# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# Stacked text layers make the glow: offset copies of a word at 45 % in `add`
# around a crisp pale copy on top, with a faint spill on the wall behind.
# Text is always black-keyed, so a glow or shadow colour must never be
# exactly 000000 — it would vanish. Full-width boxes centre it on any panel.
S - Neon Sign
U 32 32
L color 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Wall
K 06000a
L color 0 5 0 22 normal 100 none fill 1
N Spill
K 14031a
L text -1 9 0 0 add 45 black fill 1
N Glow L
T lit OPEN
F large ff2d95 c none 0
L text 1 9 0 0 add 45 black fill 1
N Glow R
T lit OPEN
F large ff2d95 c none 0
L text 0 8 0 0 add 45 black fill 1
N Glow U
T lit OPEN
F large ff2d95 c none 0
L text 0 10 0 0 add 45 black fill 1
N Glow D
T lit OPEN
F large ff2d95 c none 0
L text 0 9 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Tube
T lit OPEN
F large ffc2e0 c none 0
L text -1 20 0 0 add 40 black fill 1
N Glow
T lit LATE
F tiny 18c8ff c none 0
L text 1 20 0 0 add 40 black fill 1
N Glow
T lit LATE
F tiny 18c8ff c none 0
L text 0 20 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Tube
T lit LATE
F tiny b8f4ff c none 0
